Template: privgate-console/bind
Type: select
Choices: All interfaces (0.0.0.0), This computer only (127.0.0.1)
Default: All interfaces (0.0.0.0)
Description: Network bind address
 Other computers can open the management console when it listens on every interface.

Template: privgate-console/web_port
Type: string
Default: 3000
Description: Management web port
 Browser port for the PrivGate console.

Template: privgate-console/agent_port
Type: string
Default: 3001
Description: Client / broker port
 Port Windows endpoints use for /api/agent.
